  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "DSH Architecture Lab",
      "text": "> A controlled evaluation and experimentation plugin for DeepSeek agent architectures.\n\n[English](README.md) · [繁體中文](README.zh-TW.md) · [简体中文](README.zh-CN.md) · [GitHub Source](https://github.com/f0909172434/dsh-architecture-lab) · MIT License\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "💡 About the Project",
      "text": "**DSH Architecture Lab** is a lightweight, pure-headless DSH plugin and CLI toolkit designed to scientifically, objectively, and safely evaluate and compare different **AI Agent architectures** on realistic software engineering tasks."
    },
    {
      "section": "💡 About the Project",
      "text": "Benchmarking AI agents often suffers from prompt drift, context contamination, or unmetered costs. DSH Architecture Lab provides a rigorous, reproducible evaluation environment powered by **isolated container sandboxes**, **micro-cent budget guards**, and **objective external judges**.\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 Key Highlights",
      "text": "- **🛡️ Strong Sandbox Isolation**:\n  Executes agent trials inside isolated Lima Linux VM containers or macOS Seatbelt sandboxes with complete memory, filesystem, and process separation.\n\n- **💰 Micro-Cent Accounting & Budget Guard**:\n  Features an embedded billing proxy with SQLite transaction locks that meters every API dispatch in real-time, enforcing strict budget ceilings (default NT$300 allowance)."
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 Key Highlights",
      "text": "- **⚖️ Objective External Judge**:\n  Evaluation runs through decoupled external test cases in an isolated sub-process, ensuring unbiased scoring free from agent self-reporting artifacts.\n\n- **📊 4 Balanced Recipes**:\n  Systematically compares native conversation, long-term memory, multi-step planning, and hybrid architectures under matched experimental conditions."
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 Key Highlights",
      "text": "- **⚡ Pure Headless Plugin & CLI**:\n  Streamlined architecture with zero frontend bloat, purpose-built for fast CLI execution, automated batching, and structured reporting.\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "🔬 Architecture Recipes",
      "text": "| Recipe | Memory Mechanism | Planning Mechanism | Profile Characteristics |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: | :--- |\n| **A** | Native DSH Context | Native DSH Direct Execution | **Baseline**: Minimalist single-agent conversational reasoning |\n| **B** | **Engram Long-term Memory** | Native DSH Direct Execution | **Memory-Augmented**: Vector embeddings retrieve historical context |\n| **C** | Native DSH Context | **Plan-and-Execute** | **Planning-Augmented**: Explicit step decomposition and sequential verification |\n| **D** | **Engram Long-term Memory** | **Plan-and-Execute** | **Full Hybrid**: Combines historical experience retrieval with structured execution |"
    },
    {
      "section": "🔬 Architecture Recipes",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "section": "📈 Live Empirical Results (DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash)",
      "text": "Under the frozen research protocol, the lab executed a live quartet trial using **DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash** on task `stale-fee` (fee calculation business logic repair):"
    },
    {
      "section": "📈 Live Empirical Results (DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash)",
      "text": "| Recipe | External Tests | Requests | Wall Time | Cost (TWD) | Performance Summary |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :--- |\n| **Recipe A** (Baseline) | **7 / 7 Passed** | 6 | 16.2s | NT$ 0.1513 | Fast and steady baseline repair |\n| **Recipe B** (Engram Memory) | **7 / 7 Passed** | 5 | **11.0s** | **NT$ 0.1441** | 🚀 **Fastest & most cost-effective** (Highest ROI) |\n| **Recipe C** (Plan-and-Execute) | **7 / 7 Passed** | 12 | 44.0s | NT$ 0.3110 | Generated 100% correct code with detailed step verification |\n| **Recipe D** (Full Hybrid) | **7 / 7 Passed** | 11 | 32.4s | NT$ 0.4201 | Successfully combined memory and structured plan execution |"
    },
    {
      "section": "📈 Live Empirical Results (DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash)",
      "text": "> **Key Takeaway**: In focused code repair tasks, **Recipe B (Engram Memory)** demonstrated superior convergence speed, achieving 100% pass rates with the fewest requests and lowest cost.\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "1. Requirements",
      "text": "- **Node.js**: v24 or later\n- **Python**: 3.10 or later\n- **Virtualization**: macOS native Seatbelt or Lima Linux VM (Docker)"
    },
    {
      "section": "2. Run Tests & Diagnostics",
      "text": "Clone the repository and run verification locally without requiring an API key:\n\n```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "Run all 85 unit and integration tests (~1.7s execution time)",
      "text": "npm test"
    },
    {
      "section": "Check system environment, VM, Docker image, and pricing status",
      "text": "npm run lab -- doctor\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "3. Check Lab Status",
      "text": "Query current recipe selection, remaining budget, and recorded trial history:\n\n```bash\nnpm run lab -- status\n```\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "🧪 Research Trial Management",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm run lab -- select B               # Select active recipe (A/B/C/D)\nnpm run lab -- check-one              # Run offline compliance check\nnpm run lab -- run-one stale-fee 1 B  # Execute a live trial under protocol protection\nnpm run lab -- report                 # Generate comparative report (comparison-v2.json)"
    },
    {
      "section": "💼 Daily Workspace Tasks",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm run lab -- daily-import project.json   # Safely snapshot and import a project\nnpm run lab -- daily-task task.json       # Draft a daily task\nnpm run lab -- daily-preview <runId>      # Preview generated code diffs\nnpm run lab -- daily-adopt <runId>        # Adopt changes into project workspace\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "📂 Project Architecture",
      "text": "```text\n├── src/                # Core engines (Broker proxy, Judge sandbox, Manager coordinator)\n├── tasks/              # Controlled task specifications (fee calculation, date boundaries, etc.)\n├── test/               # 85 automated test suites with high coverage\n├── state/              # Durable experiment ledger (SQLite registry, budget ledger, protocol)\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "📄 License",
      "text": "This project is licensed under the [MIT License](LICENSE)."
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH 架构实验室 (DSH Architecture Lab)",
      "text": "> 专为 DeepSeek 智能体打造的受控架构评测与实验插件\n\n[English](README.md) · [繁體中文](README.zh-TW.md) · [简体中文](README.zh-CN.md) · [GitHub 源码](https://github.com/f0909172434/dsh-architecture-lab) · MIT License\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "💡 项目简介",
      "text": "**DSH Architecture Lab** 是一套轻量、纯后端的 DSH 插件与命令行工具，旨在以科学、客观且安全的方式，评估与对比不同 **AI 智能体（Agent）架构** 在真实编程任务中的解决能力、推理耗时与 Token 成本。\n\n传统的 AI 评测往往容易受到提示词变动、上下文泄漏或环境污染的影响。本实验室通过**隔离容器沙箱**、**微额预算看门狗**以及**独立客观裁判**，为各类代理架构提供严谨、可重现的基准对比环境。\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 核心特色",
      "text": "- **🛡️ 严密的安全沙箱**：\n  在独立的 Lima Linux 虚拟机或 macOS Seatbelt 沙箱中运行受试代理，保证内存、文件系统与进程完全隔离，确保测试环境纯净。\n\n- **💰 精确微额计费与预算保护**：\n  内置记账代理与预算防护锁，实时计算每笔 API 请求的 Token 扣费与汇率折算，设置严格的总预算上限（默认 NT$300），确保实验安全受控。\n\n- **⚖️ 客观外部裁判**：\n  由独立的评判模块比对代码修改后的执行结果，与受试模型完全解耦，确保评分客观公正。\n\n- **📊 4 种对比配方（Recipes）**：\n  系统化比较原生对话、长期记忆、分步规划与混合架构的实际效能差异。\n\n- **⚡ 纯粹的无头插件与 CLI**：\n  零多余前端，专注于高性能后端执行与终端操作，支持一键自检、批量试验与数据导出。\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "🔬 四大架构配方 (Recipes)",
      "text": "实验室针对目前主流的 AI 代理架构设计了四种受控配方：\n\n| 配方 | 记忆机制 (Memory) | 规划机制 (Planning) | 架构特点 |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: | :--- |\n| **A** | 原生 DSH 上下文 | 原生 DSH 直接执行 | **基准对照组**：最精炼的基础推理架构 |\n| **B** | **Engram 长期记忆** | 原生 DSH 直接执行 | **记忆增强组**：利用向量嵌入检索历史经验与上下文 |\n| **C** | 原生 DSH 上下文 | **Plan-and-Execute** | **规划增强组**：先分解任务为子步骤，依序执行与验证 |\n| **D** | **Engram 长期记忆** | **Plan-and-Execute** | **混合完整组**：结合长期经验检索与结构化多步规划 |\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "📈 最新实测发现 (DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash)",
      "text": "在已冻结的研究协议下，实验室使用真实 **DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash** 模型完成了首组四重奏试验（任务：`stale-fee` 手续费业务规则修正）："
    },
    {
      "section": "📈 最新实测发现 (DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash)",
      "text": "| 配方 | 外部测试通过率 | 请求次数 | 实际耗时 | 实际花费 (TWD) | 综合表现 |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :--- |\n| **配方 A** (原生基准) | **7 / 7 通过** | 6 次 | 16.2 秒 | NT$ 0.1513 | 表现稳定，快速完成修正 |\n| **配方 B** (Engram 记忆) | **7 / 7 通过** | 5 次 | **11.0 秒** | **NT$ 0.1441** | 🚀 **速度最快、成本最低**（性价比最高） |\n| **配方 C** (分步规划) | **7 / 7 通过** | 12 次 | 44.0 秒 | NT$ 0.3110 | 产出代码完全正确，步骤验证较为严谨 |\n| **配方 D** (混合架构) | **7 / 7 通过** | 11 次 | 32.4 秒 | NT$ 0.4201 | 成功整合经验与规划，产出完整说明 |"
    },
    {
      "section": "📈 最新实测发现 (DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash)",
      "text": "> **核心实证洞察**：在具体代码修复任务中，**配方 B（Engram 记忆架构）** 展现出显著的收敛速度优势，以最少请求与最低费用达成 100% 正确修复。\n\n---"
    },
    {
